Features

Real-time network traffic analysis
Advanced feature engineering for better threat detection
Handles class imbalance using SMOTE
Interactive visualization dashboard
Comprehensive performance metrics
Support for Google Drive integration

📊 Dataset
The model is trained on cybersecurity intrusion data with the following key features:

Network packet size
Protocol type
Login attempts
Session duration
Encryption methods
IP reputation scores
Browser information
Temporal access patterns

🔧 Technical Stack

Python 3.x
Scikit-learn
Pandas
NumPy
Seaborn
Matplotlib
Google Colab integration
React (for dashboard)

📈 Performance Metrics

Detection Rate
False Alarm Rate
Confusion Matrix Analysis
Classification Report
Feature Importance Rankings


🚀 Getting Started

Clone the repository

bashCopygit clone https://github.com/yourusername/cybersecurity-intrusion-detection.git

Install required packages

bashCopypip install -r requirements.txt

Mount Google Drive and configure data path

pythonCopyfrom google.colab import drive
drive.mount('/content/drive')

Run the model

pythonCopypython main.py
📊 Dashboard
The project includes an interactive dashboard for:

Real-time monitoring
Attack visualization
Protocol distribution analysis
Key metric tracking

📚 Model Components

Data Preparation

Feature scaling
Categorical encoding
